		z-index: 100;
		height: 72px;
		padding: 0 7%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ebf1;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
	}

	.logo {
		color: #172033;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 800;
